              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Angela W"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this almost exactly as listed except I used all chicken broth, no water or veggie broth, added in carrots and celery (I like lots of veg) and only added pepper to taste, per other reviewers suggestion. The boys loved it and asked for seconds!",
